# Use CLAUDE.md First

Before implementing or refactoring agent code in this repository, read `CLAUDE.md` and follow its guidance.

When working on LangGraph agents with Idun tools, follow the `LangGraph + Idun tool pattern` section in `CLAUDE.md` for:

- async tool loading with `get_langchain_tools`
- `MessagesState` + `ToolNode` routing shape
- avoiding `asyncio.run()` at module import time
